      "created_at": "2015-05-27T09:06:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had a situation yesterday in which Visionary went into TK cocoon and then the environment played the card that plays the top card of each deck from Ruins of Atlantis (can't remember name off-hand). I thought the ruling on that was that Visionary can't play cards, but cards from her deck can be played by outside effects (that card, OmX, etc.) but the game basically prevented the card play caying that Vis cannot play cards. I'd guess the same thing might come up with Bunker's Turret mode, would have to check that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Basically, which is it, can game effects such as timeshift or that card from Ruins play cards from hero decks when the hero cannot play cards due to TK, etc. or not?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm asking over here first before putting in a bug report, in case the ruling has changed.&nbsp;</p>",
