      "created_at": "2015-05-27T11:11:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Based on wording of Ruins of Atlantis what happened in the app would be correct. &nbsp; Timeshift is different in that it reveals a card then you decide whether to discard it or put into play. &nbsp; The wording on Atlantean says to play the top card of your deck which is why it got blocked. &nbsp;</p>",
