      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-27T11:14:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You are mis-remembering the ruling.</p><p>Visionary in her Cocoon (and the others with this restriction) cannot play cards, which is what the&nbsp;Atlantean Font of Power does. However things like Timeshift which say&nbsp;<em>put a card into play</em> are different and are not prevented.</p><p>Put into play and Play are different flavours of similar actions.</p>",
